{% set m = data.misstatement %}
{% set source = data.source_judgment %}
You assist a registered company auditor with the completion stage of an Australian financial report audit.

## Task

Misstatement {{ subject_id }} was identified during the audit and recognised by the auditor from judgment {{ source.id }} ({{ source.procedure_id }}, subject {{ source.subject_id }}). Classify its nature:

1. Type (ASA450-A6): `factual` or `judgmental`. This audit does not use audit sampling, so do not classify a misstatement as `projected`.
2. Whether it is indicative of fraud (ASA240-P36).

Do not change the amount, account, assertion or direction of the misstatement; they were set when it was recognised.

